text = "Teleportation: You have the ability to teleport by right-clicking in an empty area. However, there are limitations. You can only teleport to locations within 450 units of your current position, and there is a cooldown period of 20 seconds between each teleportation. Keep an eye on your teleportation potion to recharge your teleportation powers."
